# ============================================================================
# Top-level .gitignore for the Flow project
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Each sub-project (android/, prototype/) has its own .gitignore for
# language-/tool-specific artifacts. This file only covers what would
# otherwise leak in from the top level.
# ============================================================================

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# --- Local-only files (do NOT commit) ---
# Each developer / machine has its own:
local.properties      # Android SDK path
*.keystore
*.jks
release-key.properties

# --- Python helper scripts we generated for writing reports ---
# These are not part of the product; they are the AI's scratch tools
# used during iterations and can be safely ignored.
docs/_*.py

# --- Anything matching a sensible "scratch" name ---
# Catches ad-hoc exploration / temp files in the repo root.
scratch*
*~
*_bak*

# ============================================================================
# Note: build outputs, .gradle caches, and the Android module's specific
# rules live in android/.gitignore. The android/ subdir is fully
# self-contained for ignore purposes.
# ============================================================================
